{"unit_id":"JayLi52__dsh-web-search-doubao#card-zh","repo":"JayLi52/dsh-web-search-doubao","commit":"ce8a6cfabf53bb8d3a4f9bf57fc2c2e567acf8c8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-search-doubao 是 DSH Web 的豆包搜索提供方，通过 ctx.web 注册，并由 bundle 默认选择 doubao。它将搜索词发送到 feedcoop global_search，把网页链接、标题、文本摘要和发布时间整理为 DSH 搜索结果；无链接结果会被忽略。用户可设置结果数量和摘要长度，API 认证错误会明确返回。适合希望在 DSH Web 会话中使用豆包联网搜索的用户。需要提供 feedcoop Bearer token，可使用 DOUBAO_SEARCH_API_KEY 环境变量或插件 apiKey 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:84-114","index.js:122-190","cordis.patch.yml:8-15"]}
